# Cloudflare static-asset redirects. Copied to out/_redirects by `next build`.
#
# The deployed site currently serves /privacy, but this repo defines the page
# at /privacy-policy — so redeploying would 404 the URL people already have.
# Both stores require the privacy policy URL you register to keep resolving,
# and Play flags a listing whose policy link goes dead.
#
# /privacy-policy is canonical (it matches app/privacy-policy/).
/privacy      /privacy-policy   301
/privacy/     /privacy-policy   301
